DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260810T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260810T214500
UID:fa5e9e2824777e9aef29651a@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This six-week course on Monday evenings will introduce you to 
