BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Qigong
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260825T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260825T183000
UID:1f7305b52ad505bede8c0a40@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Qigong (pronounced "chee-gong") is a system of exercises which
  helps us cultivate awareness and connect with our bodies through simple b
 reathing exercises and movement techniques\, and can be a great way to pre
 pare for meditation. Join us for a beginner-friendly session led by Serene
 . No experience necessary.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/qigong-25-aug
END:VEVENT
