DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260825T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260825T213000
UID:811afdc1948ec12aa727a4a8@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:You can either learn to meditate from scratch and develop the 
