BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Celebrating Bhante’s Birthday
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260826T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260826T213000
UID:2527b6f7fa0fa0dd6e9bcf2e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This day marks the birthday of our founder and teacher 'Bhante
 ' Urgyen Sangharakshita. Devamitra – who lived and worked closely with B
 hante – will be interviewed by Satyabhasa about his life\, and his uniqu
 e approach to the Buddhist vision.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/celebrating-bhantes-birt
 hday-26-aug-2026
END:VEVENT
