BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kum Nye Tibetan Yoga Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260829T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260829T170000
UID:2d4c58f2a281332d4d26eede@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Kum Nye is a Tibetan movement practice\, similar to tai chi or
  yoga. This workshop explores simple exercises using movement\, breath and
  awareness to release tension and develop a deeper sense of ease in both b
 ody and mind.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/kum-nye-tibetan-yoga-wor
 kshop-sat-29-aug
